  m_Name: Door3ExitQuestion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: "As illustrated in the information presented on your screen, following
    the \r\ncollection of 4 letters, What attributes cause 'name' to be considered
    a non-static \r\n(instance) variable?"
  answers:
  - Because it is declared without the static keyword, and it belongs to each object 
    of the Student class.
  - Because it is declared without the non-static keyword, and it belongs to each 
    object of the Student class.
  - Because, It is associated with every instance of the Student class.
  - All of the above.
